sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: The tool call path through the Muse tether
  accDescr: Pi sends the prompt to the model through the tether and the official client. The model's tool call comes back the same way to Pi, which runs the tool and saves the result, and only then does the result go back to the model.
  participant P as Pi
  participant T as Tether
  participant C as Official Muse client
  participant S as Muse model
  P->>S: prompt, tools and history, through the tether and client
  S-->>C: tool call
  C-->>T: tool call
  T-->>P: tool call
  Note over P: runs the tool, saves the result
  P->>T: result
  T->>C: result
  C->>S: result
  S-->>P: answer
